WEBVTT

00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:30.733
Tahrir Square,

00:02:30.733 --> 00:02:35.039
Taksim Square in today's headlines in Istanbul,

00:02:35.039 --> 00:02:37.399
or, yes,

00:02:37.399 --> 00:02:40.191
Tiananmen Square in Beijing.

00:02:40.191 --> 00:02:41.897
(Applause)

00:02:41.897 --> 00:02:44.823
Those are the public spaces

00:02:44.823 --> 00:02:48.188
where we announce ourselves as citizens,

00:02:48.188 --> 00:02:51.634
as participants, as people with the right

00:02:51.634 --> 00:02:55.909
to write our own narratives.

00:02:55.909 --> 00:02:58.587
Cities are not only the oldest of institutions,

00:02:58.587 --> 00:03:00.555
they're the most enduring.